{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Seek international agreement not to develop super intelligent AI until safe",
        "additional_details": "Control must be peer reviewed in the government and scientific community until a broad consensus of safety is reached.\r\n \r\nAnthropic and former OpenAI researcher Jacob Coxon resigned September 2026 with the following statements:\r\n\u201cThe people building AI earnestly believe that it could kill us all by the end of the decade\u2026\u201d\r\n\u201cThey are racing straight to self-improving superintelligence and gambling with our lives\u2026\u201d\r\n \r\nAnthropic Alignment-Science lead Evan Hubinger response:\r\n\u201cJacob is correct here \u2013 we really do earnestly believe AI could kill all humans! I personally think it is >10% within the next decade.\u201d",
        "background": "UK must ensure that until it is proven that advanced AI can be controlled with a scalable mechanism there must be an agreement between governments not to allow training, building, or progression of general super intelligence. ",
        "closed_at": null,
